      "writtenOn": "2016-09-21T00:06:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "David, it is required because the pysaml2 library needs some value to generate the ns0:SingleSignOnService node of the metadata. But none of keystone consumes this value and a keystone IdP isn\u0027t able to act as a WebSSO yet (so I\u0027m told, see http://eavesdrop.openstack.org/irclogs/%23openstack-keystone/%23openstack-keystone.2016-09-14.log.html#t2016-09-14T19:32:13], so that part of the metadata doesn\u0027t really have meaning. So it\u0027s not a broken default.",
      "parentUuid": "7a8ec9b2_76776dd4",
